{"title":"The Arcade Series Gaming Earbuds Collection","description":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDiscover\n        the pinnacle of gaming audio with the \u003cb\u003eArcade Series Gaming Earbuds\u003c\/b\u003e, featuring the Arcade 800 and Arcade\n        900. As \u003cb\u003ePakistan's First Gaming Earbuds\u003c\/b\u003e, this collection redefines what it means to game on the go,\n        delivering cutting-edge features tailored for gamers who demand the best. With sleek designs, Hyper Low Latency,\n        RGB lighting, and unbeatable battery life, the Arcade Series is your pocket-sized gaming studio.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy\n            Choose the Arcade Series?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe\n        Arcade Series combines innovation, style, and functionality in two unique designs—Arcade 800 and Arcade 900.\n        Both models share the same powerful features, ensuring you never miss a beat or a shot, no matter which design\n        you choose.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 4;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eKey\n            Features Across the Arcade Series:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul type=\"disc\"\u003e\n    \u003cli class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\n        \u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHyper\n                Low Latency (40M\/S):\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\n            Experience seamless, lag-free gaming with ultra-fast connectivity that ensures every move is in sync.\u003c\/span\u003e\n    \u003c\/li\u003e\n    \u003cli class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\n        \u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRGB\n                Lighting:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\n            Stand out in style with customizable RGB LED lights on both the case and earbuds, making every victory a\n            statement.\u003c\/span\u003e\n    \u003c\/li\u003e\n    \u003cli class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\n        \u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eImmersive\n                Audio:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\n            Feel the game like never before with 10MM HyperBass Drivers delivering high-resolution, immersive\n            soundscapes.\u003c\/span\u003e\n    \u003c\/li\u003e\n    \u003cli class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\n        \u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExtended\n                Battery Life:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\n            Enjoy up to 50 hours of standby playback. Need a quick charge? Get 120 minutes of playback with just 10\n            minutes of charging.\u003c\/span\u003e\n    \u003c\/li\u003e\n    \u003cli class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\n        \u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTouch\n                Controls:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\n            Full touch control functionality for intuitive navigation during gaming and streaming.\u003c\/span\u003e\n    \u003c\/li\u003e\n    \u003cli class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\n        \u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eENC\n                \u0026amp; Quad Mic:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\n            Enhanced noise cancellation with quad microphones for crystal-clear communication during team plays.\u003c\/span\u003e\n    \u003c\/li\u003e\n    \u003cli class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\n        \u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAI\n                Voice Assistant:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\n            Effortless control with AI-powered voice commands, keeping your hands free and your focus sharp.\u003c\/span\u003e\n    \u003c\/li\u003e\n    \u003cli class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\n        \u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIPX4\n                Water Resistance:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\n            Durable and sweat-proof, perfect for gaming marathons or casual outdoor use.\u003c\/span\u003e\n    \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eArcade\n            800 vs. Arcade 900 – Aesthetic Choices for Every Gamer\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul type=\"disc\"\u003e\n    \u003cli class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\n        \u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eArcade\n                800:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\n            A sleek, dynamic design that exudes modernity and power. Ideal for gamers who prefer bold and contemporary\n            styling.\u003c\/span\u003e\n    \u003c\/li\u003e\n    \u003cli class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\n        \u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eArcade\n                900:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\n            A refined design with a touch of elegance, perfect for gamers who value subtle sophistication alongside\n            top-tier performance.\u003c\/span\u003e\n    \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWho\n            Are the Arcade Series For?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhether\n        you’re a competitive gamer, a casual streamer, or an audiophile, the Arcade Series has something for\n        everyone:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul type=\"disc\"\u003e\n    \u003cli class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\n        \u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGamers:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\n            Enjoy lag-free gaming with ultra-low latency and powerful audio immersion.\u003c\/span\u003e\n    \u003c\/li\u003e\n    \u003cli class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\n        \u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStreamers:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\n            Enhance your experience with long-lasting playback and crisp sound.\u003c\/span\u003e\n    \u003c\/li\u003e\n    \u003cli class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\n        \u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEveryday\n                Users:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\n            Perfect for music, calls, or workouts, with features like noise cancellation, water resistance, and RGB\n            lighting.\u003c\/span\u003e\n    \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy\n            Zero Lifestyle’s Arcade Series?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe\n        Arcade Series is more than just a pair of earbuds; it’s a revolution in gaming audio technology. With features\n        that rival even the most premium earbuds in the market, the Arcade 800 and Arcade 900 offer unbeatable value,\n        style, and performance at an accessible price point.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStep\n        into the future of gaming audio with the Arcade Series by Zero Lifestyle. Choose your design, grab your pair,\n        and redefine the way you game, stream, and listen!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"arcade-800","title":"Zero Arcade 800","description":"\u003ch1\u003eThe Arcade Series Gaming Earbuds\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePakistan’s First Gaming Earbuds, making it the ultimate wireless companion for every gamer. Powered with 40M\/S Hyper Low Latency, RGB Case \u0026amp; Buds along with 50 Hour Standby Playback time, the Arcade Series is your gaming studio in your pocket.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Arcade 800\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHyper Low Latency:\u003c\/strong\u003e Experience true wireless freedom without any lagging with The Arcade Series 40M\/S Hyper Low Latency, giving you reliable connections at ultra-fast speed.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRGB Case \u0026amp; Buds:\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your victory, wherever and whenever with the Arcade Series’ sleek design paired with RGB LED lights in your case and earbuds, making a style statement for every gamer.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncredible Audio Immersion:\u003c\/strong\u003e Enjoy high-resolution audio with 10MM HyperBass Drivers, transporting you to your in-game environment.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUnbeatable Battery Life with Ultra Fast Charging:\u003c\/strong\u003e With 50 hours standby playback, your gaming sessions never end. Power up with ultra-fast charging, giving you 120 minutes of playback in just 10 minutes!\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Arcade 800 \u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAuto Gaming Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e Full-color touch screen.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Controls:\u003c\/strong\u003e Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eENC \u0026amp; Quad Mic:\u003c\/strong\u003e Steps, calories, various exercise modes.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHyper Low Latency:\u003c\/strong\u003e Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAI Voice Assistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long-lasting, multi-day battery life on a single charge.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Suitable for intense workouts.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Arcade 800\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you’re looking for the true wireless experience to enhance your gaming, whether you’re at home, on the go, or in your studio, then the Arcade Series is a must-have for every gamer. Even if you’re not into gaming and just looking for something to stream, the Arcade Series offers over 50 hours of playback battery with HyperBass audio, giving you the vibes you want in every beat.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":49364896645398,"sku":"22438","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"White","offer_id":49364896678166,"sku":"22505","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/01_daf239cb-87c2-4d48-894c-ff0cbcf652df.webp?v=1771068896"},{"product_id":"arcade-900","title":"Zero Arcade 900","description":"\u003ch1\u003eThe Arcade Series Gaming Earbuds\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePakistan’s First Gaming Earbuds, making it the ultimate wireless companion for every gamer. Powered with 40M\/S Hyper Low Latency, RGB Case \u0026amp; Buds along with 50 Hour Standby Playback time, the Arcade Series is your gaming studio in your pocket.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Arcade 900\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHyper Low Latency:\u003c\/strong\u003e Experience true wireless freedom without any lagging with The Arcade Series 40M\/S Hyper Low Latency, giving you reliable connections at ultra-fast speed.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRGB Case \u0026amp; Buds:\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your victory, wherever and whenever with the Arcade Series’ sleek design paired with RGB LED lights in your case and earbuds, making a style statement for every gamer.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncredible Audio Immersion:\u003c\/strong\u003e Enjoy high-resolution audio with 10MM HyperBass Drivers, transporting you to your in-game environment.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUnbeatable Battery Life with Ultra Fast Charging:\u003c\/strong\u003e With 50 hours standby playback, your gaming sessions never end. Power up with ultra-fast charging, giving you 120 minutes of playback in just 10 minutes!\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Arcade 900\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAuto Gaming Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e Full-color touch screen.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Controls:\u003c\/strong\u003e Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eENC \u0026amp; Quad Mic:\u003c\/strong\u003e Steps, calories, various exercise modes.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHyper Low Latency:\u003c\/strong\u003e Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAI Voice Assistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long-lasting, multi-day battery life on a single charge.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Suitable for intense workouts.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Arcade 900\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you’re looking for the true wireless experience to enhance your gaming, whether you’re at home, on the go, or in your studio, then the Arcade Series is a must-have for every gamer. Even if you’re not into gaming and just looking for something to stream, the Arcade Series offers over 50 hours of playback battery with HyperBass audio, giving you the vibes you want in every beat.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":49399249305878,"sku":"22436","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":49399249338646,"sku":"22503","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Arcade-900-Black-7.webp?v=1771069079"},{"product_id":"striker-earbuds","title":"Striker Earbuds","description":"\u003ch1\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStriker Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSleek and Dynamic Design\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCrafted for style and comfort, the Striker Earbuds are available in three bold color choices—Black, Green, and Camo.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompact Build:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds measure 34.99 × 21.15 × 24.88 mm.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePortable Charging Case:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dimensions of 60.73 × 63.96 × 42.44 mm.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLightweight:\u003c\/strong\u003e Total weight of just 48.9 g, ensuring a comfortable fit for extended use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLong Battery Life \u0026amp; Efficient Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnjoy uninterrupted performance with a robust battery setup.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtended Playtime:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 27.5 hours in total, with approximately 5.5 hours of continuous playback at 70% volume.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFast Charging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully recharges in about 2 hours via a Type-C input (1W for the case, 0.5W output).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReliable Batteries:\u003c\/strong\u003e Powered by Jingshan Yifan Energy Co., Ltd. with an earbud battery capacity of 35mAh and a case capacity of 400mAh.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStandby Duration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds last about 60 days; charging case lasts up to 120 days.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Wireless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExperience effortless pairing and uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLatest Bluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e Equipped with \u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth V5.4\u003c\/strong\u003e for stable connections.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReliable Range:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maintains connectivity within \u003cstrong\u003e≥10 meters\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHassle-Free Pairing:\u003c\/strong\u003e Supports \u003cstrong\u003eautomatic pairing\u003c\/strong\u003e for an effortless user experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGame Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e Low-latency performance with \u003cstrong\u003e65ms response time\u003c\/strong\u003e for immersive gaming.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntuitive Touch \u0026amp; Voice Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnjoy easy management with sensitive touch controls.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlay\/Pause:\u003c\/strong\u003e Single tap on either earbud.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCall Handling:\u003c\/strong\u003e Answer with a tap, double-tap to hang up, long press (2–3 seconds) to reject.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Activation:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long press the \u003cstrong\u003eleft earbud\u003c\/strong\u003e (3 seconds) for Siri or Google Assistant.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGaming Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long press the \u003cstrong\u003eright earbud\u003c\/strong\u003e (3 seconds) for a low-latency experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFactory Reset:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tap \u003cstrong\u003efive times\u003c\/strong\u003e while pairing L \u0026amp; R, then place them in the case and remove to confirm reset.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSuperior Audio Experience\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eImmerse yourself in powerful sound clarity.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Quality Drivers:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e13mm audio drivers\u003c\/strong\u003e deliver a frequency range of \u003cstrong\u003e20Hz–20kHz\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOptimized Sensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e111.5±3dB\u003c\/strong\u003e ensures balanced sound performance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClear Calls:\u003c\/strong\u003e Equipped with a \u003cstrong\u003e2718 silicone microphone\u003c\/strong\u003e for superior voice capture.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI ENC Technology:\u003c\/strong\u003e Enhances call noise reduction for crisp conversations.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Certified \u003cstrong\u003eIPX4\u003c\/strong\u003e for protection against splashes and light rain.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEarbud Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 34.99 × 21.15 × 24.88 mm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Case Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 60.73 × 63.96 × 42.44 mm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 48.9 g\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e About \u003cstrong\u003e2 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\